    - target: {fileID: 2625978853664738727, guid: 93cbbb2baffe67a439128842db69e2c9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: ringManager
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 2143671679}
    - target: {fileID: 2625978853664738727, guid: 93cbbb2baffe67a439128842db69e2c9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nextSceneName
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2625978853664738727, guid: 93cbbb2baffe67a439128842db69e2c9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: scrollContent
      value: 'What the Old One Knows The Hermit has been here a long time. Long enough
        to remember when the Weaver first started to hesitate. Long enough to watch
        The great tapestry stop feeling like a gift and start feeling like something
        else. Every destiny written before the first breath drawn. All of it is decided.
        All of it inevitable. The Weaver did not create fate. The Weaver enforced
        it. And one day the Weaver looked at what they had built and could not continue.
        You sit with that for a long moment. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2713550664584638487, guid: 93cbbb2baffe67a439128842db69e2c9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5279213525990488120, guid: 93cbbb2baffe67a439128842db69e2c9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'What the Old One Knows

        The Hermit has been here a long time.

        Long
        enough to remember when the Weaver

        first started to hesitate. Long
        enough to watch

        The great tapestry stop feeling like a gift

        and
        start feeling like something else.

        Every destiny written before
        the first breath drawn.

        All of it is decided. All of it inevitable.

        The
        Weaver did not create fate.

        The Weaver enforced it.

        And
        one day the Weaver looked at what they

        had built and could not continue.

        You
        sit with that for a long moment.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5279213525990488120, guid: 93cbbb2baffe67a439128842db69e2c9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_VerticalAlignment
      value: 512
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6901582510289893953, guid: 93cbbb2baffe67a439128842db69e2c9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
